{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"那份甜意已让他舍不得，他开始在意自己在对方心里是否也有分量。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始在意自己在对方心中的分量，希望这份亲近也被对方同样珍惜。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"短促急切的念头像一闪而过的关系疑问，能支撑他初次在意彼此的分量，又符合整段仍然温柔、没有明显冲突的听感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\",\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里安稳，却又觉得有些空落；前面尝过亲近的满足后，单是平静下来已不足以让他心满意足。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"安稳下来时，他心里的渴望仍会留下；平静不再等同于满足。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"舒适的停留感与段内轻微的阻滞并置，适合表现他内心尚未消退的渴望，而不必把不安归因于对方是否同样在意他。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1a66648d-ad8e-4fd8-8608-f4b5cb18f7b8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T033441283143Z", "elapsed_seconds": 106.859, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:36:28.157952+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc6ca64e0984bfc96108acd803718ed6126bc75a18cb268f8901124fbddf10df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9